    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "终于到午休了，你今天想吃什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我带了饭，不过不太多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "我也带了。要不要一起坐这边？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，这里比较安静。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "你现在习惯自己带午饭了吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "差不多了。自己带比较省时间。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "而且想吃什么就可以准备什么。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，不过我做饭的种类还不多。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "慢慢学。这个周末你可以试一个新菜。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好主意。你午休一般做什么？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "吃完饭以后，我会走十分钟。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我常常坐着看手机，可能不太好。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "偶尔没问题，不过走一走下午更有精神。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "那今天我跟你一起走。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "可以。下午你还有那个邮件吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有，写完以后我还要整理明天的资料。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_WANG_MING_001",
      "textZh": "时间够，不用着急。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc003_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "好，先好好吃饭。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
